    "\n",
    "**Course:** DSC 478: Programming Machine Learning Applications\n",
    "\n",
    "End-to-end data science notebook which covers a wide-array of data science pipeline components such as, data ingestion, preprocessing (data cleaning/manipulation), feature engineering, exploratory data analysis (descriptive statistics), feature selection, and machine learning models (Linear/Logistic Regression, K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN), Decision Trees (DT), Random Forest (RF)) for predicting Letterboxd movie ratings.\n",
    "\n",
